    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Attractive and well positioned 3-Bed Bungalow of c 82 sqm on c 0.75 acres with Workshop and stunning Sea Views!\r\nLOCATION UNMATCHED!\r\nTo simply use a word like ‘beautiful’ to describe the views and setting of this Fethard-On-Sea home would be a true injustice! Breath taking sea views enhance your daily life here indefinitely. Residing on c. 0.75 acre elevated site with mature front and rear garden, overlooking a picturesque coastline, is this delightful 3-bed bungalow. This property boasts tastefully decorated, bright and spacious living areas and is only a 1-minute walk away from a beautiful sandy cove! The popular and bustling seaside village of Fethard-on-Sea with its many amenities and sandy beaches is only a short walk and the Hook Head Peninsula with its historic Hook Lighthouse and stunning coastline, as well as the beautiful walking trails of Tintern Abbey, are both just a 10 minutes’ drive away. This property would make the perfect Holiday Getaway / Retirement or Family Home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\t        - \t2.82m x 1.98m PVC entry door with glass inserts, solid Pine wood flooring, recessed lighting, sliding coat closet and access to attic and inner hallway.\r\nInner Hallway \t                -\t3.14m x 0.88m solid Pine wood flooring, hot-press and access to attic.\r\nLiving / Dining Room\t-\t7.16m x 3.61m open plan to dining room with solid Pine wood flooring, 3.25m high vaulted and painted wood paneled ceiling with recessed lighting, solid fuel stove with marble hearth, Box-Bay window with Countryside and Sea views, sliding patio doors to rear garden from dining area and access to kitchen from living area.\r\nKitchen / Utility        \t- \t4.20m x 2.40m porcelain tile flooring, recessed lighting, contemporary custom designed and hand-crafted ‘Evoke’ kitchen with under cabinet adjustable lighting, pink Silestone countertops and very unique graphic printed porcelain tile splash back, Siemens induction hob, top-of-the-range integrated electric Siemens Studio Line oven with built-in microwave, integrated Siemens dishwasher, large Siemens fridge/freezer, breakfast bar, 6 UK drop-down electrical sockets with USB charger, large skylight, washing machine hook-up, and back door access to private rear garden\r\nBedroom 1                 \t-  \t4.23m x 2.51m solid Pine wood flooring, built-in wardrobes and double windows with views of rear garden area.\r\nBedroom 2                \t-\t2.98m x 3.07m solid Pine wood flooring, built-in sliding wardrobes, Box-Bay window boasting spectacular Sea views and en-suite.\r\nEn-Suite\t                        -\t1.93m x 1.42m high quality cushioned linoleum flooring, glass enclosed and paneled electric Triton shower, WC, WHB and window.\r\nBedroom 3                 \t-\t3.03m x 2.95m solid Pine wood flooring and Box-Bay window boasting great Beach and Sea views.\r\nBathroom                   \t-\t3.11m x 1.86m porcelain tile flooring, heated towel rack and large glass-enclosed power shower unit with wall panels, WC, modern free-standing vanity unit with WHB, black handles and tile splash back."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Beautifully finished and decorated 3-Bed Bungalow with stunning Sea and Beach views.\r\nNew contemporary custom designed and hand-crafted ‘Evoke’ kitchen with unique features.\r\nQuality wood and tile flooring throughout.\r\nC 0.75 acre elevated and landscaped site with mature front & rear lawns and an abundance of                   \r\nshrubs and trees.\r\nConcrete and gravel driveway.\r\nWhite double glazed PVC windows, brown PVC gutters, painted pebble dash finish and tile roof.\r\nSolid-built workshop 3.68m x 2.99m with tiled roof, door and window.\r\nTiled rear patio area.\r\nOnly a 1-minute walk to a beautiful sandy cove via direct path from the house.\r\nWalking distance to the village of Fethard-on-Sea with many amenities and beautiful beaches.\r\nOnly a short drive away from the famous Hook Lighthouse and Tintern Abbey."
      },
